Package: kulan-welcome
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @PUBLISHER@ <@MAINTAINER_EMAIL@>
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Depends: kulan-base (= @VERSION@), python3 (>= 3.11), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.4), flatpak
Recommends: kulan-desktop-settings (= @VERSION@), kulan-settings (= @VERSION@), gir1.2-nm-1.0, gufw, deja-dup
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: @NAME@ Setup Assistant
 Opens at first sign-in. Get online, choose your look and privacy settings,
 bring over files from another computer, add popular apps, download Ask
 Kulan's model and see which protections are on.
